    <description><![CDATA[<p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="120">00:02:00</a>  在雪山脚下想到人类进化</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="576">00:09:36</a>  事情为什么越来越复杂</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="926">00:15:26</a>   人工智能参照《人类简史》解答人类为何变得复杂</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1164">00:19:24</a>  祖先的智慧去哪儿了？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2229">00:37:09</a>  旅行中远离了日常，反而更看清了日常</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3180">00:53:00</a>  旅行当中爱做决定</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3872">01:04:32</a>  旅行让我们从日常的秩序中超脱出来</span></p><p><span>书</span></p><p><span>《人类简史》 作者：（以色列）尤瓦尔. 赫拉利</span></p><p><span>题图</span></p><p><span>山顶上的思考者  摄影：卓别灵</span></p><p><span>片头片尾曲</span></p><p><span>《问题出现我再告诉大家》 by 五条人</span></p>]]></description>
