    <description><![CDATA[<p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="122">00:02:02</a> 煮蛋器：有人天天用，有人当摆设</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="352">00:05:52</a>  豆浆机：敌不过超市买豆浆的便捷</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="467">00:07:47</a>  空气净化器：效果不明</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="714">00:11:54</a>   艾绒：呼吸道杀手</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="891">00:14:51</a>   歹物重灾区：美容小家电</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1484">00:24:44</a>  智能戒指：难看</span></p><p><span>                筋膜枪：自己操作容易受伤</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1737">00:28:57</a>   保健药剂：增加代谢负担</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2335">00:38:55</a>  漂亮的歹物让人欲罢不能</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2700">00:45:00</a>  书架上的歹物：缺了一本书的全集</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2910">00:48:30</a>  公认歹物：旅游纪念品</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3125">00:52:05</a>  虚拟歹物：钓鱼式营销、小红书、抖音、微信</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3838">01:03:58</a>   关系型歹物：孩子</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4531">01:15:31</a>    轻歹物：合同期很长的工作项目</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4789">01:19:49</a>   经典歹物：男人</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5285">01:28:05</a>  为什么画、花瓶和文具不被列为歹物</span></p><p><span>片头、片尾曲</span></p><p><span>《头上的包》  by 何勇</span></p><p><span>题图摄影：坤航</span></p>]]></description>
