  <item>
    <title>Vol.043 女人五十，以及理想中的退休party</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6a03014be1eb34a939407aef</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6a03014be1eb34a939407aef</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 22 May 2026 16:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>对天水来说，今年是“大数儿”加“大事儿”。</span></p><p><span>“大数儿”这个说法源自几年前一位朋友的50岁生日，当天他时不时感慨一句：哎呀我都到大数儿了。</span></p><p><span>从那以后，身边但凡有人到50岁，我们都调侃说，哎呀你到大数儿了。</span></p><p><span>这不，朋友圈一向以小辈儿自居的天水一转眼也到大数儿了。</span></p><p><span>同时，她也接到了办理退休手续的通知。</span></p><p><span>但这一切都不重要，最令人兴奋的是，终于可以向卓别灵看齐，办一个有趣的退休party了！哈哈哈！</span></p><p><span>于是我们畅想了一番……</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="110">00:01:50</a> 火不离人：卓别灵退休计划Call back</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="440">00:07:20</a> 天水：灵活就业人员是怎么退休的</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="925">00:15:25</a> 一个人的退休身份</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1151">00:19:11</a> 被工作定义的社会身份</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1374">00:22:54</a> 天水对退休趴踢的憧憬</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1849">00:30:49</a> 退休趴策划案之芳州版</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2163">00:36:03</a> 还记得40岁的纪念方式吗</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2507">00:41:47</a> 退休趴策划案之卓别灵版</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3023">00:50:23</a> 50岁之后的改变</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3619">01:00:19</a> 退休之后更需要建立生活秩序</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3743">01:02:23</a> 人生下半场对上半场的回归</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4054">01:07:34</a> 朋友们，展望60岁吧</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4494">01:14:54</a> 总之，恋爱这件事不能退休</span></p><p><span>片头、片尾曲：</span></p><p><span>Celebration by Madonna</span></p><p><span>封面图：</span></p><p><span>卓别灵书法习作</span></p><p><span>延展收听：</span></p><p><span>Vol.009 何以解忧，唯有退休</span></p><p></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/66a5a8f5f718b7442642b01b/luWdEeCYCraZt69dNDXCitK5yGFw.m4a" length="84201302" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:26:46</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FvWO90e4qXGdJgaVq7ORelUE0Mza.jpg"/>
